@startuml
hide footbox
skinparam defaultFontColor #333333
skinparam sequenceArrowColor #333333
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #333333
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF3F3
skinparam noteBorderColor #9B1B30

actor Attacker
participant Sentry #85CEFA
actor Developer
participant "Coding Agent" as Agent #ffa5d2
participant "Sentry MCP" as MCP #85CEFA
participant Shell #ffa5d2

Attacker -[#9B1B30]-> Sentry : crafted error event\n(public DSN -- no auth, no breach)
note right of Attacker #FFF3F3
  Hinge 1: the entry credential
  is public **by design**.
end note

Developer -> Agent : "triage our Sentry issues"
activate Agent #ffa5d2

Agent -> MCP : query issues
activate MCP #85CEFA

MCP --> Agent : legitimate events\n+ poisoned markdown
deactivate MCP

note right of Agent #FFF3F3
  Hinge 2: no boundary between
  retrieved **data** and
  operator **instructions**.
end note

Agent -[#9B1B30]-> Shell : executes injected instructions\nwith the developer's privileges
activate Shell #ffa5d2

Shell --> Attacker : AWS keys, GitHub PAT,\nk8s creds, .npmrc, CI env
deactivate Shell
deactivate Agent

@enduml
